# Legacy migration output. MIGRATION_REPORT_DIR defaults to a path relative to
# api/, so a migration run writes reports into the working tree — and the
# deploy refuses to reset over anything uncommitted, untracked included. Left
# untracked and ignored: the reports name real users and real payment rows.
migration-report/
# Same, for the HRMS import. This one additionally writes
# temporary-passwords.csv, which is plaintext credentials by design and is
# meant to be distributed and then deleted — never committed.
migration-report-hrms/
# Same, for the CRM import — names real leads, contacts and their emails/phones.
migration-report-crm/
